      "text": "The best living room addition choice depends on how much space is needed, where the addition can fit, how it will connect to the existing house, and whether another solution meets the same goal with less construction. Compare a conventional addition, a reconfigured existing room, a garage conversion, and an ADU only after checking intended use, privacy, access, utilities, and property constraints.",
